WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 13]

01:42.159 --> 01:44.039
My life is hanging by a thread.

01:45.399 --> 01:48.080
It's been so long
since I felt such a thrill.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.320
Miss Ye.

02:12.679 --> 02:14.359
Are you busy later?

02:16.600 --> 02:18.120
No.

02:19.279 --> 02:20.519
If so,

02:24.880 --> 02:27.000
please send me home.

02:27.679 --> 02:30.680
If I do die on the way back,

02:30.719 --> 02:32.320
please collect

02:33.080 --> 02:34.720
my body for me.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.160
Wang.

03:14.600 --> 03:16.330
What did Deng Ziyue tell you just now?

03:16.350 --> 03:17.740
You two were acting mysteriously.

03:17.760 --> 03:20.040
He said he found leads on the murderer

03:20.040 --> 03:20.999
in Baoyue Pleasure House.

03:20.999 --> 03:22.959
He brought his men there
to check it out.

03:23.070 --> 03:23.900
What else is there?

03:23.920 --> 03:25.460
And,

03:25.480 --> 03:27.780
Mr. Chen is concerned about your injury.

03:27.800 --> 03:30.340
He wants you to head to his residence.

03:30.360 --> 03:32.020
So, are we heading to his residence now?

03:32.040 --> 03:33.239
That's right.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.440
Have you been there before?

03:39.279 --> 03:40.050
No.

03:40.070 --> 03:42.219
I've never been there
even since I came to the Capital.

03:42.239 --> 03:43.359
What about you?

03:44.760 --> 03:46.219
I heard Mr. Chen was living

03:46.239 --> 03:48.680
in the mountains outside the city.

03:49.239 --> 03:50.680
He's a mysterious man.

03:56.439 --> 03:57.519
Wan'er,

03:58.200 --> 04:00.680
I was very touched
when I heard what you said

04:00.840 --> 04:02.239
in front of Li Chengze.

04:05.399 --> 04:08.639
Actually, the trip
to Northern Qi was perilous.

04:08.880 --> 04:10.479
Shen Zhong was tough to deal with.

04:10.559 --> 04:12.080
I confronted him many times.

04:12.080 --> 04:14.499
I was caught between
life and death many times.

04:14.519 --> 04:17.120
I was lucky that I got to return alive.

04:22.439 --> 04:24.079
I don't like

04:24.319 --> 04:25.639
Northern Qi at all.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.480
I never want to go there again.

04:27.600 --> 04:30.279
Now that Shen Zhong is dead,
many of them hate me.

04:31.040 --> 04:34.000
They spread rumors about me
to ruin my reputation.

04:35.040 --> 04:35.619
Really?

04:35.639 --> 04:36.380
Of course.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.050
You can ask Wang if you don't trust me.

04:38.319 --> 04:39.299
I can testify for him.

04:39.319 --> 04:42.260
Mr. Fan was speaking the truth.

04:42.280 --> 04:43.360
You see?

04:45.800 --> 04:48.719
Last night, sparse rain
was in gusty wind.

04:49.119 --> 04:51.639
I still feel tipsy
after a good night sleep.

04:51.800 --> 04:54.279
I try to ask the maid
rolling up the drape.

04:54.360 --> 04:57.959
She answers crabapples are same as before.
[*Haitang means crabapples]

04:58.879 --> 05:01.639
Don't you know? Don't you know?

05:01.920 --> 05:05.440
Leaves should thrive
but flowers should wilt.

05:09.800 --> 05:11.079
Oh no.

05:15.720 --> 05:17.480
It's such an excellent poem.

05:17.679 --> 05:19.240
I heard that you wrote it.

05:19.999 --> 05:21.099
That's not true.

05:21.119 --> 05:22.500
You didn't write it?

05:22.520 --> 05:24.130
I copied it from somewhere else.

05:25.239 --> 05:25.900
Oh, right.

05:25.920 --> 05:29.020
You said you got your poems
from your dreams.

05:29.040 --> 05:30.719
You didn't write them yourself.

05:30.840 --> 05:32.500
I won't copy them again.

05:32.520 --> 05:34.460
It's not good
to deceive the world for fame.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.820
If so, this poem

05:35.840 --> 05:37.020
is your last, then?

05:37.040 --> 05:38.360
What a masterpiece.

05:38.999 --> 05:39.700
Wan'er,

05:39.720 --> 05:40.960
the situation was grave back then.

05:40.960 --> 05:42.500
Haitang was there to kill Xiao En.

05:42.520 --> 05:44.800
I used that poem to save him.

05:44.840 --> 05:45.940
Excellent choice.

05:45.960 --> 05:48.880
The poem suits her perfectly.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.599
Our lives were on the line.

05:50.679 --> 05:52.320
I dared not take it lightly.

05:52.910 --> 05:54.260
You did it out of self-defense?

05:54.280 --> 05:55.480
Yes, self-defense.

05:56.999 --> 05:59.380
If so, on the birthday banquet
of Northern Qi's empress dowager,

05:59.400 --> 06:01.739
did you dance together
with Haitang Duoduo

06:01.759 --> 06:03.300
to protect yourself as well?

06:03.320 --> 06:05.159
That was a martial arts competition.

06:06.520 --> 06:08.140
You promised me
that you wouldn't deceive me.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.759
It was truly a competition.

06:12.840 --> 06:15.759
However, the process wasn't that strict.

06:18.280 --> 06:20.399
Wan'er, I'll be honest with you.

06:20.559 --> 06:22.460
Haitang does get along well

06:22.480 --> 06:23.940
with me.

06:23.960 --> 06:25.279
I take her as a friend.

06:25.679 --> 06:27.880
But only as a friend. That is all.

06:33.879 --> 06:36.000
I swear. I'm not lying.

06:40.879 --> 06:44.800
I'm asking you this
because I'm worried about Miss Haitang.

06:45.079 --> 06:46.719
Why are you worried about her?

06:46.800 --> 06:48.999
She's the disciple of Grandmaster Ku He.

06:48.999 --> 06:50.179
She's the Northern Qi Holy Maiden.

06:50.199 --> 06:52.880
How could she be a concubine?

06:54.030 --> 06:55.360
These two matters are totally different.

06:55.360 --> 06:56.790
That will never happen.

06:58.999 --> 07:01.360
If so, when will you
write a poem for me, then?

07:06.400 --> 07:07.880
That's quite difficult.

07:08.439 --> 07:10.099
Why is it difficult when it comes to me?

07:10.119 --> 07:13.480
That's not it.
I can copy poems for other people.

07:13.960 --> 07:15.360
But for you,

07:16.040 --> 07:17.440
I want to write them myself.

07:17.639 --> 07:19.040
You have to give me some time.

07:20.319 --> 07:21.680
How long do I have to wait?

07:23.880 --> 07:26.120
It's best if you can
wait for the rest of your life.

07:48.570 --> 07:50.670
[Chen Pingping's Private Residence,
Chen's Manor]

07:59.639 --> 08:01.079
Isn't this manor

08:01.119 --> 08:02.800
gigantic?

08:03.720 --> 08:05.279
Why is there no one here?

08:19.079 --> 08:20.199
Hurry up!

08:20.759 --> 08:21.839
Miss.

08:21.920 --> 08:23.060
Excuse me.

08:23.080 --> 08:24.260
Do you know where Mr. Chen is?

08:24.280 --> 08:26.199
Pingping? He's in the backyard.

08:27.480 --> 08:28.599
Thank you.

08:31.720 --> 08:34.640
Ladies, the chilled yogurt is ready.

08:34.880 --> 08:36.119
Give it a try.

08:36.679 --> 08:37.719
The chilled yogurt is ready.

08:37.719 --> 08:38.999
The yogurt is ready?

08:39.040 --> 08:40.120
Ladies, have a try.

08:40.120 --> 08:41.200
Let's try it.

08:42.959 --> 08:43.359
Is it nice?

08:43.359 --> 08:43.900
Yes.

08:43.920 --> 08:45.239
Push me.

08:45.319 --> 08:47.079
When's my turn?

08:47.400 --> 08:48.959
Wait a little longer.

08:49.920 --> 08:51.320
Push me higher!

08:51.679 --> 08:52.879
Put your back into it!

08:57.920 --> 08:59.320
The wind is here!

09:07.640 --> 09:08.999
I'm losing strength!

09:09.319 --> 09:11.040
Help me out!

09:13.479 --> 09:14.760
This smells so nice.

10:10.199 --> 10:11.299
That's Qin Heng,

10:11.319 --> 10:12.800
the son of Qin Ye.

10:12.850 --> 10:14.100
He'll also be a mainstay

10:14.120 --> 10:16.239
in the military in the future.

10:19.079 --> 10:21.839
How much do you think it'll cost

10:22.000 --> 10:23.599
to build a giant manor like this?

10:23.920 --> 10:25.520
No one will ask about that.

10:26.319 --> 10:28.599
Is it because he's Chen Pingping?

10:48.760 --> 10:52.800
The wind so swift,

10:55.400 --> 10:57.280
the sky so wide,

11:01.640 --> 11:06.440
apes wail and cry!

11:16.599 --> 11:18.640
Water so clear

11:20.959 --> 11:23.879
and sand so white,

11:27.240 --> 11:33.160
birds wheel and fly!

11:41.839 --> 11:42.780
Mr. Fan.

11:42.800 --> 11:44.359
The boundless forest

11:47.120 --> 11:48.719
sheds its leaves

11:50.359 --> 11:52.719
shower by shower.

11:52.719 --> 11:53.800
Mr. Fan,

11:54.040 --> 11:55.640
isn't he reciting your poem?

11:56.719 --> 11:58.339
Mr. Fan, I've long heard of you.

11:58.359 --> 11:59.419
It's an honor

11:59.439 --> 12:01.020
to see you in person.

12:01.040 --> 12:03.419
I was lucky enough to witness
General Qin's flair personally.

12:03.439 --> 12:05.439
The Qin family has been
revered by all for generations.

12:05.439 --> 12:07.179
[Qin Heng, Son of Qin Ye]
Did you meet him in the court?

12:07.199 --> 12:08.279
Indeed.

12:08.550 --> 12:10.339
If so, I'm sure
you didn't witness his flair.

12:10.359 --> 12:11.559
My father always sleeps

12:11.559 --> 12:12.580
when he attends a court session.

12:12.580 --> 12:13.470
I'll be thanking the heavens

12:13.479 --> 12:15.140
if he didn't snore.

12:15.160 --> 12:16.220
The court was pretty noisy.

12:16.240 --> 12:17.459
I couldn't tell that he was snoring.

12:17.479 --> 12:19.179
Mr. Fan, sorry for the embarrassment.

12:19.199 --> 12:21.059
My father can't sleep at home.

12:21.079 --> 12:22.420
He can only sleep in the court.

12:22.440 --> 12:24.020
He didn't need
to attend every court session.

12:24.040 --> 12:25.059
He went there

12:25.079 --> 12:27.040
so that he could sleep.

12:27.640 --> 12:28.959
General Qin is extraordinary.

12:28.959 --> 12:30.740
The Qin family
have been generals for generations.

12:30.760 --> 12:32.100
I wouldn't say that he's extraordinary.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.980
But he's down-to-earth.

12:34.000 --> 12:36.320
That's a rare quality too.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.999
A thousand miles from home,

12:41.160 --> 12:43.079
I'm grieved at

12:44.079 --> 12:47.199
autumn's plight.

12:47.839 --> 12:49.160
Mr. Chen.

12:52.000 --> 12:53.080
I'm here.

12:55.160 --> 12:56.599
Ill now and then...

12:57.640 --> 12:58.579
Qin Heng.

12:58.599 --> 12:59.419
For years...

12:59.439 --> 13:00.860
He's making the call here.

13:00.880 --> 13:02.459
It's pointless to beg me.

13:02.479 --> 13:04.079
You have to talk to him.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.280
Wan'er?

13:16.280 --> 13:21.640
Living in times so hard,

13:29.400 --> 13:31.040
at frosted hair I pine...

13:37.280 --> 13:39.800
I'm here to beg for forgiveness.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.719
General Qin, what do you mean

13:43.120 --> 13:44.000
by that?

13:44.000 --> 13:46.430
Mr. Fan, ever since your appearance
at the court, the Imperial Procuratorate

13:46.430 --> 13:48.500
has been doing their best
to investigate corruption.

13:48.520 --> 13:49.339
Of course,

13:49.359 --> 13:50.939
this is great for the state.

13:50.959 --> 13:53.400
The Qin family
agrees with it wholeheartedly.

13:55.160 --> 13:58.479
I have to give up wine.

14:01.000 --> 14:03.320
I have to

14:05.106 --> 14:08.119
give up wine!

14:18.520 --> 14:20.760
Why don't you perform one more song?

14:25.959 --> 14:27.479
Why is he leaving?

14:28.040 --> 14:29.419
He's no longer in the mood.

14:29.439 --> 14:31.280
The performance depends on his mood?

14:32.719 --> 14:34.250
Music comes from the heart.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.879
There's no need to force things.

14:36.479 --> 14:37.560
Wan'er,

14:37.800 --> 14:40.220
is this your first visit
to the Chen Manor?

14:40.240 --> 14:41.640
I've always wanted to come.

14:41.880 --> 14:44.330
However, I was always sick.

14:44.350 --> 14:45.540
I couldn't leave the residence.

14:45.560 --> 14:47.260
Since this is your first time here,

14:47.280 --> 14:49.920
as your elder, I should
show you some appreciation.

14:50.599 --> 14:51.760
My legs.

14:52.199 --> 14:53.359
My legs!

15:02.359 --> 15:03.599
Wan'er, let's go.

15:15.240 --> 15:17.959
We'll leave you two to it.

15:18.040 --> 15:20.359
Ladies, all of you are dismissed.

15:23.679 --> 15:24.839
Mr. Fan.

15:25.319 --> 15:26.399
Please.

16:00.439 --> 16:02.320
I haven't died yet.

16:03.319 --> 16:05.400
Seems like
you don't need to collect my body.

16:07.559 --> 16:09.640
Did you find out
that the poison was fake?

16:10.559 --> 16:11.800
I didn't.

16:13.040 --> 16:14.059
I couldn't tell.

16:14.079 --> 16:15.760
If so, why did you take it?

16:16.000 --> 16:17.879
If one knows everything in life,

16:19.719 --> 16:21.920
living would be pointless.

16:22.199 --> 16:23.819
You might die because of it.

16:23.839 --> 16:25.239
My death

16:28.319 --> 16:29.800
would be a good thing.

16:30.920 --> 16:32.999
Our engagement will be canceled, then.

16:35.520 --> 16:36.800
You do have a point.

16:42.400 --> 16:44.400
Was Fan Xian speaking the truth?

16:44.470 --> 16:46.070
Which part were you referring to?

16:46.150 --> 16:48.059
Is the murder in Baoyue Pleasure House

16:48.079 --> 16:49.719
related to you?

16:50.839 --> 16:53.280
You might not trust me
even if I say it's not related to me.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.740
Let's just wait
for the culprit to be arrested.

16:56.760 --> 16:58.819
But the culprit is nowhere to be found.

16:58.839 --> 16:59.970
They'll find him.

16:59.990 --> 17:01.320
Are you sure about that?

17:01.559 --> 17:03.400
One cannot escape from their destiny.

17:03.400 --> 17:04.560
I think

17:07.040 --> 17:08.359
they'll find him soon.

17:19.040 --> 17:21.200
General Qin, what did you mean

17:21.839 --> 17:23.159
by that?

17:23.200 --> 17:24.839
Mr. Fan, to be honest,

17:24.960 --> 17:28.379
warfare is the only thing
the Qin family is good at.

17:28.399 --> 17:31.119
We don't know anything else.

17:31.359 --> 17:33.940
However, the Capital
is a treacherous place.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.980
What do we do
when we don't know how to survive here?

17:36.000 --> 17:37.480
We can only beg people.

17:37.490 --> 17:38.899
We establish a bond with everyone.

17:38.919 --> 17:42.560
We dare not offend Prime Minister Lin,
Crown Prince, and the rest.

17:42.960 --> 17:44.180
Does that include Second Prince?

17:44.200 --> 17:46.180
Mr. Fan, you're straightforward indeed.

17:46.200 --> 17:46.980
That's right.

17:47.000 --> 17:50.200
We send gifts to Second Prince
on festive occasions

17:50.200 --> 17:51.720
and visit him from time to time.

17:52.079 --> 17:53.819
Mr. Fan, I suppose
you can understand us.

17:53.839 --> 17:56.200
I do. You don't want to offend anyone.

17:56.319 --> 17:57.560
That's right.

17:57.950 --> 17:59.270
However, I need to clarify something.

17:59.280 --> 18:02.180
The Qin family doesn't
belong to his faction.

18:02.200 --> 18:03.720
It's just a show.

18:04.040 --> 18:07.280
Military officials like us
can only be loyal to His Majesty.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.740
If not, we'll be digging our own graves.

18:09.760 --> 18:11.960
General Qin,
you're pretty frank yourself.

18:12.200 --> 18:13.819
You get along with Second Prince,

18:13.839 --> 18:14.720
but you don't side with him.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.899
That's right.

18:15.919 --> 18:19.390
Mr. Fan, please look after us
when you investigate corruption.

18:19.399 --> 18:21.070
Did you embezzle public funds?

18:21.119 --> 18:22.500
That's not true.

18:22.520 --> 18:24.619
I swear upon my life that it's not true.

18:24.639 --> 18:26.740
If so, General Qin,
you didn't need to explain yourself.

18:26.760 --> 18:27.850
I'm just afraid

18:27.870 --> 18:29.079
we might be caught in the crossfire.

18:29.079 --> 18:31.390
The Imperial Procuratorate is
in charge of investigating corruption.

18:31.399 --> 18:32.800
Why are you begging me?

18:33.800 --> 18:35.320
In the end,

18:35.520 --> 18:37.980
they're doing this
all because of what you did.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.720
General Qin, do you think

18:40.000 --> 18:43.980
that I won't let anyone off as long as
they're affiliated with Second Prince?

18:44.000 --> 18:45.500
The roots must be exterminated,
am I right?

18:45.520 --> 18:47.720
I'm investigating corruption
to uphold the law.

18:48.119 --> 18:49.240
General Qin,

18:49.720 --> 18:51.159
this isn't a faction war.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.819
Of course.

18:52.839 --> 18:54.520
We mustn't name it as such.

18:55.680 --> 18:56.700
My father has always

18:56.720 --> 18:59.040
praised you for raising our flags

18:59.040 --> 19:00.320
in Northern Qi.

19:00.359 --> 19:01.500
Military officials like us

19:01.520 --> 19:03.919
are impressed by such feats.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.120
General Qin.

19:10.079 --> 19:14.390
Your family will be fine
as long as you don't practice corruption.

19:17.720 --> 19:21.079
Mr. Fan, the Qin family
owes you a favor.

19:40.839 --> 19:41.960
Stop right there!

19:42.839 --> 19:43.579
It's me!

19:43.599 --> 19:44.679
It's me!

19:46.079 --> 19:47.879
Don't alert them to our presence.

19:50.520 --> 19:51.420
Have you found them?

19:51.440 --> 19:52.440
A vegetable seller saw them.

19:52.440 --> 19:56.020
The three suspects in the courtyard
resemble the culprits in Baoyue Pleasure House.

19:56.320 --> 19:57.740
Have you surrounded them, then?

19:57.760 --> 19:58.619
Yes, sir.

19:58.639 --> 20:00.000
There's no escape for them.

20:21.159 --> 20:22.239
Wan'er,

20:22.440 --> 20:23.520
let me.

20:29.599 --> 20:31.000
Has Qin Heng left?

20:31.559 --> 20:33.579
He told me to bid farewell
to you on his behalf.

20:33.599 --> 20:34.640
Did you two talk it over?

20:34.660 --> 20:35.919
Does everyone in the imperial court

20:35.919 --> 20:37.919
think that I'm investigating corruption

20:38.359 --> 20:39.660
to seek revenge?

20:39.680 --> 20:40.760
You don't say.

20:40.850 --> 20:42.280
Do you wish to tell them
that you're doing it

20:42.280 --> 20:43.359
for the sake of upholding the law

20:43.359 --> 20:45.280
or serving justice?

20:46.000 --> 20:48.240
I do have a grudge against Li Chengze.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.760
But if I wanted to pick on him,

20:50.870 --> 20:53.780
I wouldn't have let
the Imperial Procuratorate proceed with the task.

20:55.359 --> 20:57.520
The rumors of a faction war

20:57.680 --> 20:59.379
were spread to shake your foundation

20:59.399 --> 21:04.560
and make the officials doubt you.

21:09.800 --> 21:12.180
So it's pointless no matter
how I try to explain myself, huh?

21:12.200 --> 21:14.399
What you say doesn't matter.

21:14.800 --> 21:16.320
What you do matters the most.

21:16.639 --> 21:18.060
If so, what do I have to do

21:18.080 --> 21:20.460
to make them believe that I'm sincere
in investigating corruption

21:20.480 --> 21:22.079
instead of picking on Li Chengze?

21:26.870 --> 21:28.790
Arrest an influential corrupt official.

21:35.639 --> 21:37.500
This is a gift from Mr. Chen.

21:37.520 --> 21:39.639
It's a box of valuable jewelry
and accessories.

21:40.520 --> 21:44.260
Chen's Manor violated the land regulations
for its size long ago.

21:44.280 --> 21:47.059
The rare gems and stones
in the manor are worth a fortune.

21:47.079 --> 21:49.700
There are all kinds
of courtesans in the manor as well.

21:49.720 --> 21:51.760
Accumulating wealth from the world

21:52.079 --> 21:54.740
and disregarding the law of the kingdom,

21:54.760 --> 21:56.560
this is a huge case of corruption.

21:57.159 --> 21:59.159
Who else better to arrest than me?

22:00.319 --> 22:00.960
But Mr. Chen...

22:00.960 --> 22:01.819
Save your breath.

22:01.839 --> 22:03.280
Next time, impeach me
in the court directly.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.350
After that, no one will dare to say

22:04.359 --> 22:07.159
that you're doing it to seek revenge.

22:07.480 --> 22:09.280
If so, how will you clean up the mess?

22:11.119 --> 22:12.960
Just do what you like.

22:14.159 --> 22:15.760
I'll handle

22:15.839 --> 22:17.270
all of the consequences.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.320
But Mr. Chen...

22:21.599 --> 22:23.000
Don't be too touched yet.

22:23.960 --> 22:25.480
Take a look at this.

22:26.839 --> 22:28.960
First Division delivered this
to me not long ago.

22:28.980 --> 22:32.240
[Detained within the cell of the First Division]
The culprits of the murder in Baoyue Pleasure House,

22:32.240 --> 22:33.380
Deng Ziyue managed to arrest them.

22:33.380 --> 22:34.379
This is great.

22:34.399 --> 22:35.579
This way,

22:35.599 --> 22:37.380
the murder will finally be solved.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.910
Mr. Chen, do you wish
to proceed with the trial?

22:38.919 --> 22:40.320
Since I'm a corrupt official,

22:40.800 --> 22:42.879
I shouldn't interfere.

22:43.240 --> 22:44.200
You're the inspector

22:44.200 --> 22:45.980
and the division supervisor
of the First Division.

22:46.000 --> 22:48.159
You should be in charge of it all.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.639
After all,

22:56.800 --> 22:58.379
you're gravely ill.

22:58.399 --> 23:00.359
You have to sit down more often.

23:05.319 --> 23:06.560
It's quite exquisite.

23:06.680 --> 23:07.700
Why don't I give you this?

23:07.720 --> 23:09.180
You can give me your old wheelchair.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.619
This wheelchair is only for me.

23:10.639 --> 23:12.139
What? Are you hiding gems inside?

23:12.159 --> 23:13.520
Maybe.

23:13.810 --> 23:15.280
You should give it a try first.

23:27.800 --> 23:30.960
This time, you shouldn't
throw it at anyone else.

23:33.559 --> 23:34.960
What are you looking at?

23:35.319 --> 23:36.790
Based on your relationship with her,

23:36.810 --> 23:38.310
I have to station my men there

23:38.680 --> 23:40.720
to protect her.

23:46.639 --> 23:47.719
Thank you.

23:48.639 --> 23:50.200
Be honest with me.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.180
Did you actually feed Li Chengze poison?

23:52.200 --> 23:52.899
Yes, I did.

23:52.919 --> 23:53.859
Did he take it?

23:53.879 --> 23:54.959
He did.

23:57.879 --> 23:59.980
However, I put the antidote in his drink

24:00.000 --> 24:01.170
when we had a toast.

24:01.190 --> 24:02.310
Were you trying to intimidate him?

24:02.319 --> 24:03.170
No.

24:03.190 --> 24:05.270
I actually thought
of killing him with poison.

24:07.960 --> 24:09.310
However, that wouldn't do.

24:09.399 --> 24:10.460
But why?

24:10.480 --> 24:12.200
Ye Ling'er had a point.

24:12.599 --> 24:14.159
What did Ling'er say?

24:15.960 --> 24:17.399
You dare not kill him, huh?

24:17.680 --> 24:18.559
But I can help you out.

24:18.560 --> 24:20.300
Even so, I can't just
kill someone because of it.

24:20.320 --> 24:21.660
How deep is the feud between you two?

24:21.680 --> 24:23.879
Why are you trying
to kill him with poison?

24:26.399 --> 24:28.320
Li Chengze

24:29.399 --> 24:31.599
doesn't take the lives
of other people seriously.

24:32.119 --> 24:33.879
Because he considers himself noble

24:34.480 --> 24:35.960
and aloof.

24:38.159 --> 24:40.200
Therefore, if I kill him with poison,

24:40.480 --> 24:42.280
I can only kill that person.

24:42.720 --> 24:44.839
However, I cannot
defeat people like him.

24:46.359 --> 24:48.339
I want to defeat Li Chengze officially

24:48.359 --> 24:50.379
using law

24:50.399 --> 24:51.780
in the imperial court.

24:51.800 --> 24:53.159
Only then will I be able
to tell the people

24:53.159 --> 24:55.399
that one's status doesn't matter.

24:56.190 --> 24:58.210
There will always
be people who will uphold

24:58.639 --> 25:00.240
and comply with the law.

25:04.680 --> 25:07.159
Comply with the law, huh?

25:14.040 --> 25:15.790
It's a quote from the stone monument.

25:17.480 --> 25:18.579
That's my mother's quote.

25:18.599 --> 25:20.500
I hope that the laws of the state

25:20.520 --> 25:22.590
are established
for the sake of the people.

25:22.879 --> 25:24.960
It won't tolerate
the wrongdoings of the noble

25:25.000 --> 25:26.919
or extort from the poor.

25:27.559 --> 25:29.170
No people will be framed

25:29.190 --> 25:31.270
or be convicted of crimes
they didn't commit.

25:31.480 --> 25:33.359
We will comply with the law,

25:33.390 --> 25:35.299
dispel the illusion,
and reveal the truth.

25:35.319 --> 25:36.679
I'm not my mother.

25:36.800 --> 25:38.320
I'm not as capable as her.

25:40.764 --> 25:43.000
I can't realize all of her dreams.

25:44.090 --> 25:46.230
However, I can at least
realize this dream of hers.

25:48.079 --> 25:50.270
Even if this is the only dream
I can realize for her,

25:52.000 --> 25:53.320
I hope

25:54.240 --> 25:56.200
that it can come true.

25:58.839 --> 25:59.919
I know.

26:01.359 --> 26:02.839
It'll be very difficult.

26:04.119 --> 26:05.280
However, my mother's quotes

26:05.280 --> 26:07.359
were carved onto the stone monument.

26:08.599 --> 26:10.439
Since I've arrived at this world,

26:11.800 --> 26:14.399
I mustn't let people
take the stone monument as a joke.

26:27.125 --> 26:29.400
[Imperial Inspectorate]

26:29.400 --> 26:31.040
[First Division
of Imperial Inspectorate]

26:31.040 --> 26:32.120
Deng?

26:33.200 --> 26:33.559
Deng?

26:33.559 --> 26:34.579
Ziyue?

26:34.599 --> 26:35.220
Ziyue?

26:35.240 --> 26:36.839
Why are you hiding here?

26:36.919 --> 26:38.919
Mr. Fan, I've failed you!

26:38.919 --> 26:39.940
Even so, you don't need to kneel.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.220
Mr. Fan, please don't!

26:41.240 --> 26:42.780
My legs are just numb.

26:42.800 --> 26:43.859
What happened?

26:43.879 --> 26:45.040
Did the culprit die?

26:45.119 --> 26:46.099
No.

26:46.119 --> 26:47.199
No.

26:47.559 --> 26:48.639
Did he run away?

26:48.800 --> 26:49.559
No.

26:49.559 --> 26:51.030
There are three culprits.

26:51.050 --> 26:52.630
None of them managed to escape.

26:53.159 --> 26:55.040
If so, why did you say you've failed me?

26:55.200 --> 26:56.619
I was too anxious.

26:56.639 --> 26:57.819
I had them interrogated

26:57.839 --> 27:00.020
before you came back.

27:00.040 --> 27:01.690
Did you not get an answer out of them?

27:02.240 --> 27:04.960
I didn't do a good job
at interrogating them.

27:05.480 --> 27:07.060
Were they not willing to confess?

27:08.839 --> 27:10.030
They did confess.

27:10.440 --> 27:11.460
I guess...

27:11.480 --> 27:12.839
I guess they did confess.

27:23.000 --> 27:24.560
Is this your testimony?

27:25.040 --> 27:26.359
Did you confess to this?

27:26.480 --> 27:28.520
You! Is this your testimony?

27:29.000 --> 27:30.080
You!

27:30.480 --> 27:32.040
You better think twice.

27:32.240 --> 27:34.639
Who ordered you all to do this?

27:34.879 --> 27:36.240
Mr. Fan,

27:36.680 --> 27:38.170
we've failed you.

27:38.190 --> 27:39.520
We failed to escape.

27:40.000 --> 27:42.200
How dare you tell such a blatant lie!

27:42.520 --> 27:43.600
Wang!

27:52.280 --> 27:53.980
So I'm the mastermind, huh?

27:54.000 --> 27:55.760
We wanted to keep it a secret too.

27:56.159 --> 27:58.320
But we couldn't
endure the harsh torture.

27:58.399 --> 28:00.159
Mr. Fan, please forgive us.

28:01.520 --> 28:02.879
Did you torture them?

28:03.599 --> 28:04.579
No.

28:04.599 --> 28:05.660
I didn't even touch them.

28:05.680 --> 28:07.480
They confessed of their own accord.

28:07.480 --> 28:08.760
Mr. Fan,

28:09.720 --> 28:11.079
we can't stand the pain.

28:13.430 --> 28:14.760
That's a great excuse.

28:14.879 --> 28:15.980
You're pretty witty.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.080
Mr. Fan,

28:17.440 --> 28:18.760
they're framing you here!

28:18.760 --> 28:20.079
You mustn't say that.

28:20.110 --> 28:21.420
I've read their testimonies too.

28:21.440 --> 28:23.460
They were logical
and contained clear motives.

28:23.480 --> 28:24.170
Say,

28:24.190 --> 28:26.919
I thought for a second that I was
the mastermind after reading it.

28:27.810 --> 28:29.399
Mr. Fan, I still think
that we have to torture them.

28:29.399 --> 28:30.559
I didn't do anything to them just now.

28:30.559 --> 28:32.000
They'll confess
if we torture them for real.

28:32.000 --> 28:32.910
- Come.
- I didn't touch them just now.

28:32.919 --> 28:33.819
Wang!

28:33.839 --> 28:35.240
It's useless to torture them.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.240
So you three

29:02.000 --> 29:03.700
were waiting for me to arrest you, huh?

29:03.720 --> 29:06.520
Mr. Fan, you mustn't say that.

29:06.720 --> 29:08.760
We tried to escape, but we failed.

29:09.950 --> 29:12.020
Have you never thought
of the consequences?

29:12.040 --> 29:13.439
Mr. Fan,

29:13.480 --> 29:15.040
you should confess to your crime.

29:15.119 --> 29:17.899
We should face reality
in the face of law.

29:17.919 --> 29:19.639
It's not too late for you to turn back.

29:19.919 --> 29:21.200
I understand now.

29:21.430 --> 29:23.070
You all are from the suicide squad.

29:30.280 --> 29:31.500
Where is the inspector?

29:31.520 --> 29:33.079
Where is the inspector?

29:33.839 --> 29:35.079
Inspector!

29:35.119 --> 29:36.359
Inspector!

29:36.800 --> 29:38.859
The Capital Magistrate
is here to take the suspects.

29:38.879 --> 29:40.139
We cannot release them!

29:40.159 --> 29:41.559
I'll make them confess right now!

29:41.559 --> 29:43.030
Let them take the suspects.

29:43.079 --> 29:44.080
Mr. Fan?

29:44.100 --> 29:46.720
Capital Magistrate is responsible for
murder investigations in the Capital.

29:46.720 --> 29:48.150
The First Division
has no reason to keep them.

29:48.159 --> 29:49.359
However, once the Capital Magistrate

29:49.359 --> 29:50.559
confirms their testimonies,

29:50.559 --> 29:52.340
you'll have no way to explain yourself.

29:52.520 --> 29:53.079
What about this?

29:53.079 --> 29:54.319
We can say that they resisted arrest

29:54.319 --> 29:56.070
when we arrested them.
After that, we killed them by accident.

29:56.079 --> 29:57.079
I... I'll kill them right now!

29:57.079 --> 29:59.439
I have no way to explain myself either
if they die here.

30:00.280 --> 30:02.280
At least it's better
than letting them frame you.

30:02.280 --> 30:02.960
That's right, Mr. Fan.

30:02.960 --> 30:04.060
Let them take the suspects.

30:04.080 --> 30:05.619
Being a person
is just like being an official.

30:05.639 --> 30:07.020
We have to obey the rules.

30:07.040 --> 30:08.120
Release them.

30:09.520 --> 30:11.520
He never bothers
with the trivial details.

30:36.240 --> 30:38.579
Seems like you're fine.
I'll make a move, then.

30:38.599 --> 30:39.760
Don't be impatient.

30:40.040 --> 30:41.690
What if it's a slow-acting poison?

30:41.710 --> 30:43.300
You should wait a little longer.

30:43.599 --> 30:45.180
Even if the poison does kill you,

30:45.200 --> 30:46.859
you're already in your residence.

30:46.879 --> 30:48.619
Your servants will
collect your body for you.

30:48.639 --> 30:49.639
Shouldn't heroines

30:49.639 --> 30:51.460
see things through from start to finish?

30:51.480 --> 30:52.899
I can't just wait here

30:52.919 --> 30:54.720
until you die, no?

30:56.040 --> 30:57.520
I guess that's fine too.

31:01.639 --> 31:04.310
Your Highness, the culprit
of the Baoyue Pleasure House murder

31:04.320 --> 31:05.400
was arrested.

31:09.280 --> 31:11.590
Really? He was arrested?
Who arrested him?

31:11.610 --> 31:13.150
First Division
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

31:13.159 --> 31:14.930
Fan Xian's subordinates arrested him?

31:15.120 --> 31:16.800
The Imperial Inspectorate
does live up to its name.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.899
The Capital Magistrate went there
to arrest the culprits.

31:18.919 --> 31:20.220
The Capital Magistrate?

31:20.240 --> 31:23.280
The Capital Magistrate is responsible
for all murder cases.

31:23.380 --> 31:24.899
Have they released the culprits, then?

31:24.919 --> 31:26.070
The First Division didn't stop them.

31:26.080 --> 31:27.760
They've already arrived
at the Capital Magistrate.

31:27.760 --> 31:29.610
The prefect is taking
this case seriously.

31:29.630 --> 31:30.710
He put them on trial immediately.

31:30.730 --> 31:32.400
He's interrogating them as we speak.

31:33.000 --> 31:35.260
He tortured them brutally.
They fainted several times.

31:35.280 --> 31:38.180
Even so, they weren't willing
to tell him who the mastermind was.

31:38.200 --> 31:40.119
Although they murdered someone,

31:40.399 --> 31:42.240
they're loyal indeed.

31:42.720 --> 31:45.159
I agree.

31:46.520 --> 31:48.560
I confess!

31:48.680 --> 31:50.980
It's the inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate!

31:51.000 --> 31:53.839
Mr. Fan Xian ordered us to kill her!

31:54.240 --> 31:55.760
I'm speaking the truth!

31:55.760 --> 31:57.639
I dare not lie!

32:01.319 --> 32:04.220
Father, Little Xian is here!

32:04.240 --> 32:07.139
Father, Little Xian is here!

32:07.159 --> 32:10.320
Father, Little Xian is here!

32:12.399 --> 32:13.560
Come up.

32:19.639 --> 32:20.410
Mr. Lin.

32:20.430 --> 32:21.800
Weren't you gravely ill?

32:22.000 --> 32:24.200
Mr. Lin, I was just
pretending to be ill.

32:30.960 --> 32:33.280
Little Xian, you've recovered already?

32:34.319 --> 32:35.800
Don't tell anyone about it, okay?

32:39.440 --> 32:42.679
I'll tell everyone
that you're still sick.

32:42.919 --> 32:43.980
Dabao, you're the best.

32:44.000 --> 32:45.119
Dabao.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.280
Father.

32:48.399 --> 32:50.000
Go and play.

32:50.520 --> 32:53.020
Father, don't forget, okay?

32:53.040 --> 32:55.099
You must take Dabao to the study later.

32:55.119 --> 32:57.500
Don't let the others bully him, okay?

32:57.520 --> 32:58.679
Okay.

32:59.599 --> 33:01.679
Little Xian, I'll wait for you.

33:04.839 --> 33:06.079
Dabao?

33:12.639 --> 33:16.720
He calls this little red fish Dabao.

33:19.879 --> 33:22.320
Whether you're truly ill or not,
it no longer matters.

33:22.559 --> 33:26.539
Did you know that the Capital Magistrate
already solved the case?

33:26.559 --> 33:28.299
The three culprits were sure

33:28.319 --> 33:29.890
that you were their mastermind.

33:29.910 --> 33:30.940
I've heard about it.

33:30.960 --> 33:31.940
Was it you?

33:31.960 --> 33:33.040
No, it wasn't me.

33:34.839 --> 33:36.339
It's all part of Chengze's plot, huh?

33:36.359 --> 33:37.879
Those culprits

33:38.040 --> 33:39.960
belong to the suicide squad under him.

33:40.440 --> 33:41.780
Mr. Lin, you're wise indeed.

33:41.800 --> 33:43.240
You were careless.

33:43.599 --> 33:44.839
You arrested them first.

33:44.840 --> 33:46.980
Everything would've been fine
if they died in the First Division.

33:47.000 --> 33:49.130
Why did you let
the Capital Magistrate take them?

33:49.919 --> 33:51.980
Baoyue Pleasure House
is related to the Fan family.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.060
I won't be able to explain myself

33:53.080 --> 33:54.760
if they die in the First Division.

33:54.879 --> 33:58.560
Even so, it's better than
letting them convict you of a crime.

33:59.960 --> 34:02.520
Luckily, you did a good job before this.

34:02.760 --> 34:05.480
You implicated Chengze in the case
with Baoyue Pleasure House.

34:06.599 --> 34:08.419
After Mei Zhili's retirement,

34:08.439 --> 34:11.439
the current Capital Magistrate prefect
is close to Chengze as well.

34:12.600 --> 34:14.999
We can only strike from there.

34:15.680 --> 34:16.919
We can say

34:17.000 --> 34:19.540
that the Capital Magistrate
tortured them into confessing

34:19.560 --> 34:20.999
for Second Prince's sake.

34:22.160 --> 34:24.399
The Capital Magistrate
is close to me now.

34:24.479 --> 34:27.519
If the prefect tortures them
into confessing,

34:27.600 --> 34:29.519
Fan Xian will be in deep trouble.

34:30.680 --> 34:31.760
You're right.

34:31.839 --> 34:33.060
That might happen.

34:33.080 --> 34:34.260
Therefore,

34:34.280 --> 34:37.039
in order to be open and upright,

34:37.520 --> 34:39.880
they should be transported
to the Ministry of Justice.

34:44.520 --> 34:46.680
They were transported
to the Ministry of Justice?

34:46.999 --> 34:48.260
When did it happen?

34:48.280 --> 34:50.839
I received that news
right before I came here.

34:55.240 --> 34:57.999
Li Chengze is quick to act, huh?

34:59.120 --> 35:00.839
He always has his wits about him.

35:03.839 --> 35:05.439
Even when they're there,

35:05.839 --> 35:07.839
the culprits won't
change their testimonies.

35:08.359 --> 35:09.919
I guess so.

35:10.479 --> 35:12.919
Just let them die
in the Ministry of Justice, then.

35:18.080 --> 35:19.359
That won't do.

35:22.319 --> 35:23.999
The culprits can die.

35:25.039 --> 35:26.879
And the statements can be changed.

35:27.039 --> 35:29.359
But that'll be too obvious.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.499
No one in the world will be convinced.

35:32.519 --> 35:34.359
His Majesty won't be convinced either.

35:34.640 --> 35:39.020
Fan Xian, after giving it some thought,

35:39.040 --> 35:41.080
if they do arrive
at the Ministry of Justice,

35:41.193 --> 35:42.593
you'll be

35:43.359 --> 35:44.800
in a difficult spot.

35:50.475 --> 35:56.070
[Capital Magistrate]

35:57.800 --> 35:58.880
Go now.

36:12.280 --> 36:14.519
There's one last solution.

36:14.960 --> 36:16.640
There's actually a solution to this?

36:18.399 --> 36:20.320
Baoyue Pleasure House

36:20.640 --> 36:22.999
is considered
Fan Sizhe's property after all.

36:24.120 --> 36:25.630
Making him the mastermind

36:25.879 --> 36:27.320
seems like a logical choice.

36:32.160 --> 36:34.240
You expect me to push the blame

36:34.879 --> 36:36.839
on Fan Sizhe?

36:37.200 --> 36:38.999
Someone has to be sacrificed

36:39.359 --> 36:41.320
if we want to protect you.

36:41.439 --> 36:43.359
But Fan Sizhe is my younger brother.

36:46.319 --> 36:48.120
Just like how a gecko cuts off its tail

36:48.839 --> 36:50.479
and how a hero breaks his own wrist,

36:52.399 --> 36:54.620
being cruel

36:54.640 --> 36:56.160
is better than

36:56.519 --> 36:58.240
dying here.

37:05.080 --> 37:06.200
Mr. Lin,

37:07.080 --> 37:08.919
have you ever considered this, then?

37:09.839 --> 37:12.559
If I can sacrifice Fan Sizhe today,

37:12.600 --> 37:15.280
I can sacrifice Dabao in the future.

37:19.640 --> 37:21.039
Are you willing

37:21.359 --> 37:22.800
to see me resort to that?

37:46.839 --> 37:49.039
If so, that means you're desperate.

37:53.839 --> 37:56.039
Actually, there's still
one more solution.

37:59.280 --> 38:01.140
After the three of them were arrested,

38:01.160 --> 38:02.839
I told my men to investigate

38:02.839 --> 38:05.039
their backgrounds immediately.

38:05.640 --> 38:06.999
And, I have the result.

38:08.039 --> 38:10.120
Mr. Fan, after our investigation,

38:10.120 --> 38:12.400
we found that all three of them
were convicted of murders before this.

38:12.400 --> 38:13.810
They've committed countless crimes.

38:13.830 --> 38:16.430
How will they be penalized
according to the law of Qing State?

38:16.680 --> 38:18.399
They would've been executed long ago

38:18.399 --> 38:21.090
if it weren't for the Baoyue Pleasure House
murder investigation.

38:26.160 --> 38:27.979
Who are those inside the cage?

38:27.999 --> 38:28.939
I don't know.

38:28.959 --> 38:30.399
Let's go.

38:46.210 --> 38:48.499
They'll only resort to becoming
members of the suicide squad

38:48.519 --> 38:50.800
when there's no way for them to survive.

38:52.519 --> 38:55.320
Therefore, the three of them
should've been dead long ago.

38:55.919 --> 38:57.339
If you wish to kill them,

38:57.359 --> 38:59.900
you could've done so
when they were still in the First Division.

38:59.959 --> 39:01.780
Now, they've already
given their testimonies.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.320
If you kill them right now,

39:03.399 --> 39:04.620
it'll confirm

39:04.640 --> 39:06.399
that you're trying to silence them.

39:07.879 --> 39:09.680
You're right about something.

39:10.039 --> 39:11.720
The main point

39:12.439 --> 39:14.120
is silencing them.

40:12.839 --> 40:13.700
They're trying to kill us!

40:13.720 --> 40:14.740
Let me out!

40:14.760 --> 40:16.200
Let me out!

40:42.120 --> 40:42.580
Over there!

40:42.600 --> 40:43.680
Hurry!

40:45.720 --> 40:46.499
There's one here.

40:46.519 --> 40:47.260
Keep an eye on him.

40:47.280 --> 40:48.360
All right.

40:49.919 --> 40:51.540
The rest of you, go after them!

40:51.560 --> 40:53.019
Don't let them run away!

40:53.039 --> 40:54.119
Yes, sir!

40:54.160 --> 40:55.240
Hurry!

41:15.399 --> 41:16.479
What's wrong?

41:16.560 --> 41:19.210
Your Highness, there were assassins
outside the Capital Magistrate.

41:19.230 --> 41:21.479
They assassinated
the three culprits on the spot.

41:22.359 --> 41:23.290
It's actually that thrilling?

41:23.310 --> 41:24.310
Are all three of them dead?

41:24.330 --> 41:25.100
Yes, Your Highness.

41:25.120 --> 41:26.479
Who killed them?

41:26.720 --> 41:29.760
It depends on who they rat out.

41:29.959 --> 41:31.060
Fan Xian?

41:31.080 --> 41:32.339
That can't be.

41:32.359 --> 41:34.479
I was saying that he was framed.

41:36.032 --> 41:37.673
Could it truly be Fan Xian?

41:37.700 --> 41:38.810
Were the assassins arrested?

41:38.830 --> 41:39.859
Most of them had escaped.

41:39.879 --> 41:41.499
That means some of them were arrested.

41:41.519 --> 41:42.620
Only one of them.

41:42.640 --> 41:44.600
They're pretty careless, huh?

41:49.479 --> 41:50.559
Your Highness.

41:54.760 --> 41:56.200
What's with that face?

41:58.359 --> 42:00.600
The identity of the assassin
has been confirmed.

42:00.999 --> 42:02.320
It's Fan Wujiu.

42:08.760 --> 42:09.939
I know him.

42:09.959 --> 42:12.039
Isn't this Second Prince's bodyguard?

42:13.280 --> 42:14.999
Second Prince?

42:15.600 --> 42:16.859
So it seems like

42:16.879 --> 42:19.439
Fan Xian wasn't the one
trying to silence them.

42:19.839 --> 42:21.800
Fan Wujiu is my bodyguard.

42:22.160 --> 42:24.240
But he's not in the Capital right now.

42:24.959 --> 42:26.800
This has nothing to do with me.

42:28.080 --> 42:29.100
He's not in the Capital?

42:29.120 --> 42:30.479
He was arrested, you know?

42:30.999 --> 42:32.419
Why should I silence them?

42:32.439 --> 42:34.680
They confessed
that Fan Xian was the mastermind!

42:36.240 --> 42:38.180
Because there have been rumors

42:38.200 --> 42:39.819
that Li Chengze might be

42:39.839 --> 42:41.979
the owner of Baoyue Pleasure House.

42:41.999 --> 42:45.280
That's why the Capital Magistrate
is siding with Chengze.

42:45.879 --> 42:48.320
The testimonies they gave before
were all fake.

42:48.399 --> 42:50.250
They might recant them

42:50.270 --> 42:52.280
if they were sent
to the Ministry of Justice.

42:52.640 --> 42:55.419
Hence, Li Chengze
decided to silence them.

42:55.439 --> 42:57.220
Everything

42:57.240 --> 42:59.120
adds up by now.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
